---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'; import data from '../../../../data/generated/ca-5gc-sim.json';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const href=(value:string)=>`${base}${value.replace(/^\//,'')}`; const driftCount=data.drift.implementationOnlyRoutes.length+data.drift.documentedOnlyRoutes.length; const sourceVersion=data.source.commit?data.source.commit.slice(0,8):data.source.ref;
const matrix=[['注册','UE_REGISTRATION · UE_REGISTRATION_CONTEXT','UE_REGISTRATION_ENSURE'],['PDU 会话','PDU_SESSION','CREATE · MODIFY_QOS · RELEASE'],['用户面','USER_PLANE_CONNECTIVITY','—'],['PFCP','PFCP_RESOURCE','PFCP_RESOURCE_CLEANUP'],['传输参与方','TRANSFER_PARTICIPANTS','—'],['边缘缓存','—','ENSURE · RECONCILE'],['虚拟组','VIRTUAL_GROUP','CREATE · ASSIGN · RELEASE · RECONCILE'],['传输 QoS','TRANSFER_QOS','BOOST · RECONCILE']];
---
<SiteLayout title="ca-5gc-sim" lang="zh">
<section class="hero"><span class="eyebrow">组件 / ca-5gc-sim</span><h1>ca-5gc-sim</h1><p class="lede">用来模拟 5GC 状态和 NF 行为。下面的 Facts、Operations 和路由都从当前 Schema 和代码里生成。</p><div class="page-tabs"><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/')}>概览</a><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/facts/')}>Facts</a><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/operations/')}>Operations</a><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/api/')}>HTTP API</a><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/standalone/')}>Standalone</a></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.facts}</strong><span>Fact semantic</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.operations}</strong><span>Operation semantic</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.implementationRoutes}</strong><span>Server 实际路由</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>2</strong><span>进程 Profile</span></div></div><div class="source-status snapshot">
      <div>
        <strong>已发布快照</strong>
        <span>站点使用最近一次同步成功的 ca-5gc-sim 数据。源码仓库是 private，Pages 构建本身不读取它。</span>
      </div>
      <code>{data.source.repository}@{sourceVersion}</code>
    </div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">能力</span><h2>现在支持什么</h2></div><p>HTTP 入口不多，但每个 semantic 代表不同的读取或操作。这里按功能列出来。</p></div><div style="overflow-x:auto"><table><thead><tr><th>领域</th><th>可读取 Fact</th><th>Mutation / Reconcile</th></tr></thead><tbody>{matrix.map(([area,read,mutate])=><tr><td><strong>{area}</strong></td><td><code>{read}</code></td><td><code>{mutate}</code></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">不在这里做的事</span><h2>这些功能由别的组件负责</h2></div></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>网络故障</h3><p>Drop、Delay、Reorder 和 Network Observation 放在 <code>ca-service-fabric</code>。</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Alias → 执行身份</h3><p>UE-A / UE-B 这类别名到执行身份的解析放在 <code>ca-provider-common</code>。</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Runtime Outcome</h3><p>SUCCEEDED / FAILED / OUTCOME_UNKNOWN 和 Reconcile 由 <code>ca-runtime</code> 处理。</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Agent-facing Tool</h3><p>模拟器不直接给 Agent 当 Tool 用。Agent 侧接口由 Runtime / <code>ca-mcp</code> 提供。</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">OpenAPI 对照</span><h2>OpenAPI 和代码是否一致</h2></div></div>{driftCount===0?<div class="notice good">OpenAPI 里的路由和 Server 实现一致。</div>:<div class="notice">目前有 {driftCount} 条路由在 OpenAPI 和 <code>internal/httpapi/server.go</code> 之间对不上。<a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/api/')}> 查看具体路由 →</a></div>}</section>
</SiteLayout>